-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and April to May came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 27% of normal in September to October and 26% in October to November. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 23% of normal on the middle of the grids. On grid 12483 the driest year was 1954 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
